WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:35.780
"Opposition"

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.370
Amazing... it looks just like a castle...

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:48.940
If you'll please wait in this hall...

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.680
Seeing this mansion...

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:57.630
does give you the feeling her clout is greater than Izmal's.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:03.680
Obviously, the family of the medium who conveys God's word to the King...

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:06.040
is immensely powerful.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:10.470
This Najayra is trying to keep you in Raginei, Kajika.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.320
It's too soon to tell.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:14.040
I'm sure of it.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:17.920
I mean, just as her invitation arrived...

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:21.520
we suddenly couldn't contact America.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:26.050
Well, until the coronation, they're also restricting travel across the border.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.890
Even so...

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.120
Welcome, guests!

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.070
Princess Najayra...

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.110
So you're Kajika.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:05.130
I finally get to meet you. I'm so happy, Kajika.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:07.590
Me, too.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:11.440
I've been looking forward to meeting you, your Highness.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:20.200
You can drop the title. We're probably about the same age.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.420
Sure.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.740
And so, now that you've met me, what do you think?

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.650
Maybe I'm not what you expected...

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.200
Honestly?

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.380
Yes, honestly.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:31.760
You're extremely interesting.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:36.060
Interesting? What do you mean by that?

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.180
It doesn't really mean anything.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.430
It's just what I thought.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.580
You're interesting, too.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.910
Your Highness...

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.110
I'm sorry about the other night.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:54.100
Ah, Eugene. I'm so glad you came.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:58.350
It was fun. Come back, and play anytime.

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:00.080
Thank you very much.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:04.220
Najayra, who's there?

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.820
They're my friends, Mother.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:12.500
They've come from America to attend Somand's coronation.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:17.660
Dropping the title again... say "His Highness" Somand.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:22.280
A title is a way of showing respect for someone.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:25.350
You think Somand deserves it?

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.370
Someone like that... awe-inspiring...

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:33.080
I'm sorry--welcome, everyone.

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:35.530
I'm Kajika Burnsworth.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.020
Of the Burnsworth Foundation?

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.710
Yes, do you know my father?

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.400
His Majesty Machaty!

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.850
Watch out!

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:55.900
Horuku, take Mother to her room.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.200
How dreadful...

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.100
There's no mistaking that blood...

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.570
Come, Madam.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:10.030
"There's no mistaking that blood?" What does that mean?

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:13.850
She looked at Kajika like she was something frightening...

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.730
I hope she's OK...

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.810
My mother has a delicate constitution... she frequently suffers from anemia.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:25.640
Well! How about some drinks before dinner?

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.440
I've prepared something interesting...

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.290
Carl!

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:42.550
Kajika?

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:44.110
Miss Kajika!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.650
Burnsworth and Rosenthal...

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.780
Amusing herself by introducing mutual enemies...

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.700
Sounds like Najayra.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:56.010
You left so suddenly last time...

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.770
I was worried.

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.100
I heard...

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.790
your father isn't too fond of my dad.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:06.830
It's ironic...

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:11.880
Burnsworth's only daughter and Rosenthal's heir...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.120
happening to meet in Raginei of all places.

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:16.490
What does Raginei have to do with it?

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.130
You don't know?

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.640
Not exactly.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.360
Tell me everything. I want to hear it from you.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.330
Twenty years ago...

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:34.610
your father's oil company was in serious trouble.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:40.020
Just then, King Machaty of Raginei...

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.890
suddenly announced development of a new mining area.

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.300
Rumaty's grandfather?

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.560
That mining area...

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:51.010
was a treasure trove, expected to yield extensive deposits.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:58.020
Every company scrambled like mad to put in a bid.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:04.720
Out of all of them, my father submitted the best terms...

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.540
so he believed Rosenthal would win.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:15.990
However...

00:07:16.070 --> 00:07:18.270
the one who got the mining area...

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.510
was nearly-bankrupt Burnsworth.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.040
Why did King Machaty pick Dad?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.550
Naturally he came under a lot of suspicion...

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:30.240
but the truth is a mystery to this day.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:36.550
Burnsworth made it through the crisis and gathered momentum...

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.400
growing miraculously into a giant financial group.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.730
And Rosenthal, on the other hand, declined?

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:48.110
Our business is a ghost of its former self.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.720
That one failure led to a chain reaction.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:58.730
And that's why your father hates my dad...

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.460
Do you hate Dad, too, Carl?

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.170
It's not an emotional thing for me.

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:09.020
Well then, it has nothing to do with us, don't you think?

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:10.870
I can't say that...

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.320
since I'm part of Rosenthal, too.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:16.420
But I want us to be friends.

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:20.990
Your real nature is to be honest and straightforward.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:25.230
You could never lie to me. That's what I like about you.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.270
You're quite free with your words...

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:53.580
You want to go to Raginei in less than two weeks?

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.950
Is that a problem?

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.970
Master Lee-Leng, you were shot in the shoulder...

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:03.780
It will take a month to recover, and you're on absolute bed rest for a week.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.540
When you say it so casually, I feel it in my shoulder.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:10.660
For your own sake, you ought to feel it a little!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:13.370
I understand; I do.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.720
Don't say anything to Kajika about the injury.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.770
I won't.

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:22.950
If she knew how unreasonable her chaperone Lee-Leng was being about this...

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:26.000
what do you suppose she would do?

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.600
I said I understand...

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.100
I couldn't tell her anyway, since we haven't heard from them...

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.460
Royal interference?

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.630
Probably so.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:43.690
But I'm sure the government of Raginei doesn't want to pick a fight with America...

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:48.500
Do you sense something? You're pretty sharp when it comes to Miss Kajika.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.630
They're restricting information?

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.720
Entirely.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.070
Before things get ugly...

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:01.850
we'd better move the Prince somewhere safer.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:04.590
I'll ask Harry's advice.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:08.820
It seems even his Highness has been affected by what happened.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:13.120
He's quieted down completely, and he even apologized to Sezun.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.780
Ah, Sezun.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:25.450
You see... His Highness insisted...

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:28.220
Your Highness Rumaty!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:35.040
Why, hello, Your Highness. I'm moved that you would come expressly to see me.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.340
How is your injury?

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.550
Nothing for you to worry about.

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:41.410
Lee-Leng...

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:44.050
about what happened... I...

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.970
Your Highness, let's not talk about that.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:53.450
There was a lot for me to learn from what happened, too.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:58.130
If Your Highness was able to get something out of it...

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:00.430
that's good enough.

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:02.560
But now, I...

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:05.210
I probably can't stay here any longer.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:06.910
Maybe so.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:12.440
However, Burnsworth's support for you is not going to change.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:16.290
Then I won't get to see you anymore...

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.100
Are you happy about it?

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.350
Not at all.

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.570
Ah! No--I mean...

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:25.970
it's just that I'd gotten used to you.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:30.270
What a shame our connection isn't broken yet...

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:34.190
I'm sure Kajika's not going to let Your Highness go.

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.160
So since I'm her chaperone...

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:42.830
well, I'll probably be getting to take care of Your Highness, too.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:47.380
It seems like Harry hopes so, too.

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:50.440
But what about you?

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:54.170
If it's a bother, I'll say something to Burnsworth...

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:59.680
I never thought I'd see the day something like that would come out of Your Highness' mouth.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.020
It's a good sign.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:08.210
It looks like I'm cut out to be a teacher.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.890
Well, I'd better go for now...

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.700
Your Highness...

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.470
what did you study today?

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:18.060
French and Arabic.

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:20.700
Well, if you need a review partner...

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.410
But you're recovering...

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.210
This is review, Your Highness.

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:28.150
In French, if you please.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.020
Oui!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:36.560
He's foolishly attached to him all of a sudden.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:38.890
I wouldn't say 'foolishly.'

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:41.830
It is a problem, though...

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:43.820
What's the problem?

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:47.200
Maybe His Highness will stop being so unreasonable.

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:51.130
Master Lee-Leng is only looking after His Highness...

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.410
at Chairman Burnsworth's request.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:55.790
His Highness, though...

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:59.250
the way he adored His Highness Somand...

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:01.650
he's starting to adore Master Lee-Leng.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:07.530
His Highness has already been betrayed by his big brother once.

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:09.750
If it happened with Master Lee-Leng...

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:17.400
I know I'm not in a position to say anything about it, but...

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:24.150
You think Master Lee-Leng would have gone that far to help His Highness, just for business?

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:29.090
That isn't how he normally acts.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.040
In that situation, he would probably resort to political methods.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:39.030
But this time he was determined to rescue His Highness, at any cost.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:43.500
What it was that pushed him to go that far...

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.900
aside from Miss Kajika, I don't know...

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:55.290
Thank you so much for dinner, Your Highness.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.760
I'm so glad you enjoyed it.

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:01.450
The others didn't seem to have much appetite, though.

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:04.320
May I pour you some more coffee, sir?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.180
No, thanks.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:09.950
You didn't have much of an appetite either, Carl.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.160
I'm not a big eater.

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:14.320
A bit suspicious...

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:17.190
or was it because Kajika was here?

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.260
What are you trying to say?

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:26.010
Nothing! I just wanted to see your face!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:30.320
I finally got you to drop your poker face in front of me.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.450
Perhaps I have Kajika to thank.

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:36.560
Say, Kajika, about Carl...

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.400
he hates women, you know.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:39.950
What nonsense--

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.770
That's not true.

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.860
From the first, Carl was...

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.400
extremely nice.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.150
That's because you didn't have a woman's air.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:53.910
Air?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:58.220
What he really hates is the very womanly type.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:01.080
Especially older women...

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:03.020
Isn't that right, Carl?

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.110
That's a bad joke.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:11.020
I'm no good with women, either.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:14.660
Now that's a bad joke, Eugene.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:18.480
Just how many women have you been with?

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:23.540
I'm no good with them. For men, women are a perpetual puzzle.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.080
The puzzle is what makes them so charming.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:29.980
You can't help chasing after a mystery.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:35.650
And so you'd call Kajika the greatest mystery of all.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.410
Perhaps Lee-Leng Huang would agree.

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:44.890
Carl, who's your mystery?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:50.140
Eh, Kajika. How do you like being a mystery?

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:52.210
I don't really get it.

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:55.870
Mustafa's an adult, so sometimes it's hard to understand him.

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.270
Shall we take a little walk, Kajika?

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.720
Sure.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.230
I'm coming too!

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.580
You can't do that.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:10.500
It'll be just us girls. Right, Kajika?

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:13.590
Wait here, Toranosuke.

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:16.450
--But--
--Toranosuke.

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:24.920
It's okay.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.280
Kajika's meeting Najayra on equal footing.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.040
"Equal footing?"

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.530
That was harsh, with Carl.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:46.300
What are you talking about?

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:50.030
Do you dislike him? All you do is say things to bother him.

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:55.630
It's better than treating men's emotions as toys, like you do.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:59.390
As toys? What does that mean? I don't understand.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:04.840
Lee-Leng Huang and Eugene both face great danger for your sake.

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:08.310
There's nothing they can do, because they love you.

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:14.080
Even so, placing them both at your side without having to order them...

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.900
that's very sneaky of you.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.360
What a strange thing to say.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:22.200
I'm not "placing them by my side" or anything like that. They're both adults.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:26.340
They can act of their own free will. No one is tying them down or anything.

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:29.240
Lee-Leng is my dear big brother.

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:33.030
Mustafa's is the soul closest to my own.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:36.820
Both of them are extremely important people to me.

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:41.150
For their sake, I would face any danger, too.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:46.630
Do you think they'd be happy to hear all of that?

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:50.230
Rumaty would probably misunderstand and be happy, though.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:55.260
He's at your house now, isn't he?

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.260
What?

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.440
It's okay, you don't have to play dumb.

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:01.740
Someone from the palace already went to get him.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.190
It looks like they failed, though.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:10.780
Instead they just injured your <i>dear</i> big brother.

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:14.000
Lee-Leng... was hurt?

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:16.130
Is it bad? Tell me!

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:19.500
It's no big deal.

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.430
I have to go home.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.960
What a shame... going home is impossible.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.040
I'm going home, definitely.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:29.400
You can't charter a plane.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.830
You wouldn't even get permission to take off.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:37.500
This is my country. No amount of money will help you.

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:40.110
That's pointlessly cruel.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:47.380
Has anyone ever really showed you their anger?

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:51.170
I think not... I'm sad for you!

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:54.580
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:18:56.390 --> 00:18:58.440
I can see it!

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:01.170
This country will bring you disaster!

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.890
Since you've gotten so involved, this country...

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:10.340
will make you and your friends taste true suffering!

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:13.500
Yours will never be a peaceful life!

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.740
If that's my fate, that's fine.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.870
We've only been alive for a decade!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:35.600
What a peaceful life means, I can't begin to guess.

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:39.460
But I do know it wouldn't suit me.

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:41.980
I just have that feeling.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.810
So I don't need any of that.

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:52.510
Miss Kajika!

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:55.240
Sorry to keep you waiting. Let's go home.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:56.770
Where's Najayra?

00:19:56.790 --> 00:20:00.290
I left her in the garden. I'm afraid we had a fight.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.970
A fight?!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.990
I knew this would happen... what a headache!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.680
If you don't fight with someone like Najayra...

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.740
you can't make friends with her.

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:12.900
You plan to make friends with her?

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:14.880
That's my intention.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:18.140
But I think I'll be pretty beat up by the time that happens!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:24.720
But we'll collide, whichever way we go.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:28.800
We'll collide, and we'll hurt each other. And then...

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:31.540
whether we hate each other or love each other...

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.690
we'll decide then.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:37.730
Kajika...

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:39.890
Carl.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:41.770
I'm so glad we could meet!

00:20:42.310 --> 00:20:45.520
I understand that things are bad between your house and my dad...

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:49.190
but I think it would be silly for us to fight, too.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:53.900
If you feel the same way, I'll be very happy.

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.400
Kajika...

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.740
Or do you really hate women?

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.560
It's definitely not my strongest subject...

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:03.840
but I wouldn't use the word "hate."

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:07.220
I couldn't function in the business world if I really hated women.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.690
I'm glad!

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:13.840
I can't promise I won't turn into a reeeally sexy woman!

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:15.210
Really se...

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:19.640
What's so funny? You too, Mustafa?

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:23.590
What's up with all of you? Enough...

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:26.650
So, shall we go home?

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:34.200
Did something fun happen tonight, sir?

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:36.330
Huh? Not really...

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:40.950
It's rare to see you like this after meeting with Princess Najayra.

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:54.100
What's wrong, Kajika?

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.210
I couldn't say it in front of Carl, but...

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.950
it seems Lee-Leng's been hurt.

00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:00.480
Master Lee-Leng?

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:05.420
Raginei tried to go get Rumaty, and then...

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:08.950
Whatever it takes, I want to get back home!

00:22:09.780 --> 00:22:13.000
Understood. We'll find a way to arrange it.

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:15.160
No matter the conditions, we'll go right away.

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:27.390
There are people outside our room!

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:32.850
Who are you people?

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:36.500
Miss Kajika Burnsworth?

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.470
The master is inside, waiting for you.

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:42.130
The master?

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:49.600
How was your audience with Her Highness Najayra?

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:51.650
That voice!

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:57.660
It's been a long time, Miss Kajika.

00:22:58.320 --> 00:22:59.940
Quinza...

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
